### Project Structure (What Was Created)

After running `setup.sh`, the `~/thesis/` directory on the Pi looks like this:

```
~/thesis/
├── setup.sh                       # The setup script you just ran
├── requirements.txt               # List of Python packages
├── venv/                          # Python virtual environment (auto-created)
├── models/                        # Where the AI model goes (Step 6)
├── src/
│   ├── __init__.py                # Required by Python
│   ├── sensors.py                 # Reads the RS485 soil sensor
│   ├── camera.py                  # Captures webcam photos
│   ├── inference.py               # Runs the AI model
│   ├── transmit.py                # Sends data over WiFi
│   └── main.py                    # Main program
├── config/
│   └── settings.py                # All settings (ports, thresholds, etc.)
├── logs/                          # System logs
└── data/
    └── retraining_frames/         # Saved photos for retraining later
```
